# Phase 04 (pre-G2) — production plan, WH (multi_r1) — G2 deliverable

Date UTC: @@DATE@@. **Status: PARTIAL / WAITING ON CONDOR** — the plan is complete in structure and all sample types have gridpack + test job submitted (clusters 884934/884935/884936, plus 884456.3/884457.3 for B_EW_Waajj_vbs); rows whose σ or N is "PENDING" are filled automatically by `scripts/make_plan.py` when the gridpacks/test jobs finish. **No bulk production has been submitted** (rule: none before G2). Nothing below is a yield. Git commit: recorded by the orchestrator.
